<urn:usf:proof-algorithm:semantic-construction-authority:1> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "Deterministically prove that exact admitted pre-realisation evidence satisfies the selected contract model, applicability, currentness, dependency, write, stop, privacy and cost constraints without using post-realisation observations as prior authority." <urn:usf:graph:foundation> .
