<urn:usf:contract-shape:semantic-first:1> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "Require one construction evidence requirement, construction proof obligation and proofblocked-or-active realisation permission, plus post-realisation completion validation, evidence and proof that never feed the permission for the same realisation; bind the exact contract resource digest so stale pre-shape packets refuse." <urn:usf:graph:foundation> .
