<urn:usf:algorithm:verified-transition-receipt:1> <urn:usf:predicate:objective> "Verify a closed tracked transition receipt by reconstructing the exact pre-state from the current source and reversible ordered delta, re-evaluating the pre-state proof, applying the same delta in memory, and matching the exact expected post-state source and semantic currentness without hashing the receipt into the state it attests." <urn:usf:graph:foundation> .
